     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: StructureDefinition EHDSECGDerivedResult</b></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"xhtTableBorder0\"><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1\"><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"The logical name of the element\">Name</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Information about the use of the element\">Flags</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Minimum and Maximum # of times the element can appear in the instance\">Card.</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"; width: 100px\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Reference to the type of the element\">Type</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Additional information about the element\">Description &amp; Constraints</a><span style=\"float: right\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/></a></span></th></tr><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSECGDerivedResult-definitions.html#EHDSECGDerivedResult\" title=\"One envelope for measurements, diagnostic statements, AI inferences and other derived biomarkers. The meaning of a non-standard result lives in a versioned definition (EHDSECGBiomarkerDefinition). Typical Core uses: the global measurement set (type measurement-set, one component per LOINC measurement) and the diagnostic statement set (type statement-set, one component per SNOMED CT finding).\">EHDSECGDerivedResult</a><a name=\"EHDSECGDerivedResult\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/conformance-rules.html#constraints\" title=\"This element has or is affected by constraints ( ecg-id-1, ecg-fsh-1, ecg-dr-1, ecg-dr-2, ecg-dr-3, ecg-dr-4, ecg-dr-5, ecg-dr-6, ecg-dr-7, ecg-dr-8, ecg-dr-9, ecg-dr-10, ecg-dr-11, ecg-dr-12, ecg-dr-13, ecg-dr-14, ecg-dr-15, ecg-dr-16, ecg-dr-17, ecg-dr-18, ecg-dr-19, ecg-dr-20, ecg-dr-21 )\" class=\"xhtConstraintStyle\">C</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\">EHDSObservation</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">ECG derived result model<br/><br/>Elements defined in Ancestors:<a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSDataSet.html\" title=\"Basic metadata for this information\">header</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Clinically relevant time or time period for the observation\">observationDate[x]</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Observation type. Code and name representing the type of the observation using the agreed code systems.\">type</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Original (conventional) name of the observation as used in the local laboratory or clinical system.\">originalName</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Observation method (measurement principle) to obtain the result.\">method</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Specimen used for this observation.\">specimen</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Identifies order and order placer this observation belongs to\">order</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Performer of the observation. Some test could be performed by the patient himself or by a care giver. Those are in the scope of this deliverable under specified conditions.\">performer[x]</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Anatomic location and laterality where the observation was performed.\">bodySite</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Result of the observation including text, numeric, coded, and other types of results of the measurement and measurement uncertainty. Content of the observation result will vary according to the type of the observation.\">result</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Reference range, multiple reference ranges of different types could be provided. Provides guide for interpretation of the result.\">referenceRange</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Information about reference intervals and result interpretation.\">interpretation</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Comments and narrative representation of the observation result and findings.\">note</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Component in case the observation consists of multiple sub-observations (e.g. blood pressure).\">component</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"Reference to the related resource from which the observation has been made. For example, a calculated anion gap or a fetal measurement based on an ultrasound image.\">derivedFrom[x]</a>, <a href=\"http://www.xt-ehr.eu/fhir/models/1.0.0/StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\" title=\"This observation is a group observation (e.g. a battery, a panel of tests, a set of vital sign measurements) that includes the target as a member of the group.\">hasMember[x]</a><br/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold\">Instances of this type can be the target of a Reference</span><br class=\"constraint\"/><span class=\"constraint\">Constraints: </span><span title=\"TODO: placeholder for invariant ecg-id-1, to be defined.\" class=\"xhtPieceBold constraint\">ecg-id-1</span><span class=\"constraint\">, </span><span title=\"TODO: placeholder for invariant ecg-fsh-1, to be defined.\" class=\"xhtPieceBold constraint\">ecg-fsh-1</span><span class=\"constraint\">, </span><span title=\"TODO: placeholder for invariant ecg-dr-1, to be defined.\" class=\"xhtPieceBold constraint\">ecg-dr-1</span><span class=\"constraint\">, </span><span title=\"TODO: placeholder for invariant ecg-dr-2, to be defined.\" class=\"xhtPieceBold constraint\">ecg-dr-2</span><span class=\"constraint\">, </span><span title=\"TODO: placeholder for invariant ecg-dr-3, to be defined.\" class=\"xhtPieceBold constraint\">ecg-dr-3</span><span class=\"constraint\">, </span><span title=\"TODO: placeholder for invari